                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                        "entry_id": "7b584e80-4aa7-339e-b21c-39485aa342a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "an bekannten Wildwechseln speziell erbaute Brücke, die es Wildtieren ermöglicht, stark befahrene Verkehrswege sicher zu überqueren"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4eb95340-d9ad-449f-b6fe-f14fb1ec5a5f",
                                "sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                                "text": "Jedes mal, wenn ich zur Arbeit fahre, fahre unter einer Grünbrücke hindurch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7171fa4-b091-49cf-ba4b-f08444d6e392",
                                "sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                                "text": "„Ein reges Nachtleben dokumentiert eine neue Infrarot-Videoanlage der Wildbiologischen Gesellschaft München auf sogenannten Grünbrücken, die Tieren helfen sollen, Straßen heil zu überqueren.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18641538-6d28-4666-9855-387bcdd97a0c",
                                "sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                                "text": "„Der Theaterpark und der Park vor der Musikschule sollen durch eine Grünbrücke verbunden werden.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b1620d1-de76-4334-a1bd-5e24dadf60ce",
                                "sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                                "text": "„Der Faktor Mobilität spielt dafür eine Schlüsselrolle. Damit er nicht vollends ausser Kraft gesetzt wird, braucht es eine Wiedervernetzung der Lebensräume mit naturnahen Korridoren und Grünbrücken, wo die Wildwechsel Strassen oder Schienen kreuzen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "53f26216-1a25-437b-a9cd-4a0d9e311a41",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b584e80-4aa7-339e-b21c-39485aa342a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                        "target_lang_word": "ecoduct",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ecoduct",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be729f32-5f21-3694-927a-cd86c39291f7",
                                        "entry_id": "dcfa5178-808f-321f-8652-baa1fccd9349",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of wildlife crossing in the form of a bridge or tunnel, usually covered with foliage and turf, which animals may use to cross roads without the risk of being hit by vehicles; a wildlife viaduct."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e68409f-cda6-4160-9fa8-ca468857599d",
                                                "sense_id": "be729f32-5f21-3694-927a-cd86c39291f7",
                                                "text": "An ecoduct was installed above the road to help wildlife cross safely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0d33d26-ab8b-4910-aee0-a750d3fe2b06",
                                                "sense_id": "be729f32-5f21-3694-927a-cd86c39291f7",
                                                "text": "Several measures can be taken to influence the circumstance for the badger in a positive way. Apart from protection and restoration of potential habitats, important measures are: restoration or development of dispersal corridors (woodlots, hedgerows), construction of tunnels or ecoducts for crossing roads, reduction of speed limits, and closure of roads for traffic at night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "888b9617-168e-4407-a2c2-d1f78f7cc48b",
                                                "sense_id": "be729f32-5f21-3694-927a-cd86c39291f7",
                                                "text": "[S]pecies preferred a particular type of passage: fox and rabbit used the pipes more than the culverts and roe deer, hare and red squirrel were only observed on the ecoduct; […] It appears that an ecoduct with a variety of habitat-types is better for a broader range of species. Design of an ecoduct is important and so is the context, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9953df52-e2e2-4fea-971e-199a70c420cc",
                                                "sense_id": "be729f32-5f21-3694-927a-cd86c39291f7",
                                                "text": "A large budget was reserved for purchasing ground, developing new natural areas, and for making \"ecoducts\" (wildlife bridges or tunnels) under/over main highways that dissected natural areas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b927f56f-129a-4c03-b5a9-5336df50423f",
                                                "sense_id": "be729f32-5f21-3694-927a-cd86c39291f7",
                                                "text": "Not far from Brănișca [in Romania], an ecoduct crosses the motorway from the Apuseni mountains to the Retezat. Like bears, wolves have been known to travel enormous distances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d5a0638-54f2-45ac-9afc-876890b08b54",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b584e80-4aa7-339e-b21c-39485aa342a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                        "target_lang_word": "green bridge",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "green bridge",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c42f633c-8653-3fed-b6e8-bcfb0daef5a9",
                                        "entry_id": "f1d909f0-c6c4-34c9-830e-a158f2c59c4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vegetation covered bridge over a motorway or railway that allows wildlife to safely cross over; a wildlife bridge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a1c4e9e-014f-49f5-8ba6-381e1cc4a0f2",
                                                "sense_id": "c42f633c-8653-3fed-b6e8-bcfb0daef5a9",
                                                "text": "Elsewhere, green bridges and mammal tunnels are being used to provide routes across the railway for animals to cross."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "acaa61aa-11e3-3382-9343-8558e94b6eba",
                                        "entry_id": "f1d909f0-c6c4-34c9-830e-a158f2c59c4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any bridge with a substantial amount of greenery, gardens, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "338511fb-a096-358d-a37c-d703f8300d01",
                                        "entry_id": "f1d909f0-c6c4-34c9-830e-a158f2c59c4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bridge in an urban environment that allows only foot and cycle traffic and helps reduce motor vehicle emissions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "35c53fb5-e57d-40c0-b7ad-a3ae9e9dce24",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b584e80-4aa7-339e-b21c-39485aa342a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                        "target_lang_word": "wildlife crossing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wildlife crossing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c2022e1-ea8d-3707-b227-766518d19dac",
                                        "entry_id": "f0dbf80c-24a7-3d3e-b4dd-d9629a4e0029",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A route, such as a length of road or highway, across which wild animals are known to travel, or constructed specifically to allow them to pass safely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "edc5ef53-4d5f-4753-b4da-30cdba69a544",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b584e80-4aa7-339e-b21c-39485aa342a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                        "target_lang_word": "écoduc",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "écoduc",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ea52735-0974-3cb9-a5d0-f0ed4a2cb187",
                                        "entry_id": "c0e4bedc-6cec-3015-aefa-ac5d13917bb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Passage aménagé à destination des animaux pour qu’ils puissent traverser sans risque une route ou un autre aménagement humain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Transport terrestre",
                                            "Développement durable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89b8b2b3-3d3b-4e1b-ad6e-47759aa1d45d",
                                                "sense_id": "1ea52735-0974-3cb9-a5d0-f0ed4a2cb187",
                                                "text": "Ils sont invisibles aux yeux des vacanciers qui les franchissent régulièrement sur les autoroutes: les « écoponts » et les « écoducs », qui permettent aux animaux de franchir les voies en sécurité, sont devenus au fil des décennies essentiels à la préservation de la biodiversité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63d74321-0703-4307-a630-8c597025d30a",
                                                "sense_id": "1ea52735-0974-3cb9-a5d0-f0ed4a2cb187",
                                                "text": "Un écoduc sous l'A9 à proximité de Roquefort-des-Corbières permettra bientôt à la petite et moyenne faune de passer d'un côté à l'autre de l'Autoroute par l'entremise de l'ouvrage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caae2c95-ea73-4787-a25d-f0a688b7a774",
                                                "sense_id": "1ea52735-0974-3cb9-a5d0-f0ed4a2cb187",
                                                "text": "On voit apparaître une diversité de dispositifs. Des écoponts, des écoducs, des tunnels, des ponts aériens, des banquettes sous les ouvrages pour les loutres et castors, des échelles de corde pour les écureuils…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e374bbb-b68d-4e28-af29-65d5d794ad0a",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b584e80-4aa7-339e-b21c-39485aa342a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "508b66ea-ff1c-3543-8eaa-f279a173b4f0",
                        "target_lang_word": "écopont",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "écopont",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "458e859c-5bc1-30ac-b0ca-26cd0d4d227e",
                                        "entry_id": "fcfa67c8-f31c-3b37-926f-047cd715db7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pont permettant le passage de la faune au-dessus d'une voie importante, généralement une autoroute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd680b19-9937-4b04-b7d1-7a4c5ba376ff",
                                                "sense_id": "458e859c-5bc1-30ac-b0ca-26cd0d4d227e",
                                                "text": "Le stade d’aménagement le plus abouti aujourd’hui pour les passages supérieurs est celui de l’écopont qui vise à reconstituer sur l’ouvrage lui-même une qualité d’habitat comparable (voire parfois supérieure) à celle du milieu naturel environnant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76fe36c7-a246-4d05-a94d-89fddf878a19",
                                                "sense_id": "458e859c-5bc1-30ac-b0ca-26cd0d4d227e",
                                                "text": "On voit apparaître une diversité de dispositifs. Des écoponts, des écoducs, des tunnels, des ponts aériens, des banquettes sous les ouvrages pour les loutres et castors, des échelles de corde pour les écureuils…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
